\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {KnowledgeClaw} realises (i)--(iii) of \S  \ref  {sec:intro} on a unified omnimodal hypergraph $\mathcal  {G}$. \textbf  {(A)\nobreakspace  {}C1} fuses entities from five modalities via canonicalisation $\kappa $ and cross-modal coreference $\chi $. \textbf  {(B)\nobreakspace  {}C2} routes each $\Delta _n\!\in \!\{\textsc  {Add},\textsc  {Del},\textsc  {Refresh}\}\!\times \!\mathcal  {D}$ through Build--Query--Reason--Update with cascading orphan eviction and in-place refresh. \textbf  {(C)\nobreakspace  {}C3} routes the query among subgraph retrieval, community synthesis and proactive discovery via a lightweight LLM intent router that covers $\mathcal  {T}_3,\mathcal  {T}_4,\mathcal  {T}_6$.}}{5}{figure.4}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{F4}{{4}{5}{\textbf {KnowledgeClaw} realises (i)--(iii) of \S \ref {sec:intro} on a unified omnimodal hypergraph $\mathcal {G}$. \textbf {(A)~C1} fuses entities from five modalities via canonicalisation $\kappa $ and cross-modal coreference $\chi $. \textbf {(B)~C2} routes each $\Delta _n\!\in \!\{\textsc {Add},\textsc {Del},\textsc {Refresh}\}\!\times \!\mathcal {D}$ through Build--Query--Reason--Update with cascading orphan eviction and in-place refresh. \textbf {(C)~C3} routes the query among subgraph retrieval, community synthesis and proactive discovery via a lightweight LLM intent router that covers $\mathcal {T}_3,\mathcal {T}_4,\mathcal {T}_6$}{figure.4}{}}
